		(uuid "1779a97e-f403-55bd-acea-5aa10d194f8b")
	)
	(text "JP1 RX SOURCE (solder jumper on the back, shipped OPEN: bridge one pair by hand):\nSolder 1-2 = PROTECTED (Q1 drives PB3; firmware PORT_INVEN on PB3).\nSolder 2-3 = DIRECT (MIDI_IN to PB3, unprotected; stock BM 8bit firmware).\nExactly one bridge: never both, and open = PB3 floats."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1ffc6bc0-3737-56f2-84f6-eeba9c25766e")
	)
	(text "Input impedance 102k. -5.5..+5.5 V -> 0..5 V (0 V CV = mid-scale, ~509). +/-12 V tolerant (clamped)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "22e0255d-621e-5645-8fb5-617625d6a5da")
	)
	(text "MIDI IN (TS): MIDI V2 NPN front end (3.3 V and 5 V senders, +/-12 V tolerant), no opto"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "54b0d28a-d05f-56df-9883-c82cb91d80b5")
	)
	(text "MCU: ATtiny1616 at 5 V; Bread Modular 8bit pin map (PA1/PA2 knobs, PA4 button,\nPA5 LED, PA6 DAC, PB3 RX). New: PB0 CV in. PB5 spare.\nUPDI J5: pin 1 UPDI, pin 2 GND (2.54 mm). Power the module from Eurorack while programming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "58157351-0f9a-5dfc-80fa-d842d6be1794")
	)
	(text "CV IN: R4/R13/R14 level shift, D3 clamp, C9 -> U4 MCP6001 follower (+5V) -> PB0 (AIN11)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7eda9460-45d7-554f-86a8-0ca0e0ffc945")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01/#FLG04/#FLG05 mark the Eurorack GND/-12V/+12V entry at J4; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the\nprotected rails, fed only through D4/D5, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a8dc9923-c53e-5b15-965d-fcc86c38ae8f")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT: U3A gain 2.2 with -1.2 x VOFF (3.98 V): DAC 0..4.34 V -> -4.8..+4.8 V,\n1k series to the jack. DC coupled (LFO firmware works)."
